{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_03_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a60ea95d7d4b088efe580061107ee57a5e2b772c94100a57d962e87d23e25d93",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000032:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba63e55bead7e4350d9f569924ed2458129858455c0df35e3262ecbdb8e7e90b",
      "text": "演唱会落幕后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea696e87792400d0edced93206346736932ede0d4c3c88bf48bc2107243c692e",
      "text": "哈啊……。ARROW・B的演唱会，\n真是超级无敌MAX，太厉害了啊……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48ae3ab44b96b3442c60da94184d48814a216d6ecadfd2fd21e9082ed3da6f6b",
      "text": "演唱会也是，之前的休息室招待也是。\n说实话，我都记不太清到底聊了些什么了……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12c50db7d5eb021b661a7906de58287e5df50757bcd473c4589c5608439110ec",
      "text": "……嗯。我其实也是这样。\n但是史密斯说的一句话，我觉得特别震撼人心。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:664a4eb11748318d4519d11cb32e6adde591d3e805d857977a9a2643ee260af9",
      "text": "“ARROW・B无论过去还是现在，都深爱着乐队与粉丝。\n正因如此，才会时刻不断地持续努力。”这句话。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b86ca9ba6371134588a1492b87c36e8158346164a2b75e122e2bcf2c95b6a40",
      "text": "……我也，对乐队的喜爱绝不输给史密斯……\n我是深爱着High×Joker的。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84d114a7bf921ea445a55100923bbbbd03c72fc1d051b2f581eafcfe11cd30df",
      "text": "无论是成员，还是支持我们的人，我都最喜欢了！\n所以……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cfafdf024fcac38c054ebf23f25c06e84bde7f755f7cd34ad51adb9fff8693d",
      "text": "我们总有一天，也想站上这样的舞台。\n……不。我绝对，要把大家带到这里来！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:893427cf49acb332c92677f853bfcaebf0b1c2c035d70cf2fa3f78eb3fe68a3f",
      "text": "隼人……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39bb01bbd91462966e00f32066b7696620d4ec9ac4e996612ffb3e49336a27ce",
      "text": "……没错！下次轮到我们，\n站上那个舞台给大家看！！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6c235e12463c9b401d26889244c04366078ab2d3cc0685911407ae4f65234e4",
      "text": "……我会跟随你的，队长。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13481ada97b1dd734bb088258525fcaf8d4b30988da993c364f007214fd736d5",
      "text": "啊啊。我们上吧，凭借我们这最强的5个人！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000177:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28a057886193dcb6a54a29b5b17a1b3f926ea3fa5b610e930eb8b4618f2636d7",
      "text": "英雄先生家的狗，好帅啊——！\n在视频里看也超级有魄力呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000196:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85b8a543b7827e3d80f628ce8d4d51eff3528752d4765acb8bc592146ffaff82",
      "text": "……两手各抱一只，杜宾犬……呢。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000212:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f50ef23ac76e524ae826cae78eb8d2ca3392571b419ff6a383df6c855abb4c1",
      "text": "狗狗视频啊，英雄仔也真会想呢！\n汪星仔和英雄仔都笑得好棒！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000223:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cabbf90030c261dd0f6908f972256e0a1bb02a2dc3e97c1d34ec43da4917e614",
      "text": "好啦，休息结束。继续练习。",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000237:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f5bcea673be736bb386aa69e30e97aebdac3727734cb53d8c60d1e8596a098",
      "text": "了解！大家，加油冲吧！",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000269:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a59031b139247789c47d3599dff427a21b21aa6764983e6145913f635e822b3",
      "text": "（自从与史密斯先生见面之后，\n大家练习起来似乎更加投入了！）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_03:1_4_001_03_j:cmd-000278:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01ba84dc2e47d08054438d1991f4d80523194e569232e5bdcfd5758f07cb4663",
      "text": "（面向出战JIF，知名度也提上来了。\n从这里开始，想要获得更多人气的话……）",
      "status": "reviewed"
    }
  }
}
